      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "A transform moves where the picture is read from, never its colors. Here Translate slides the checkerboard, Rotate turns it half a turn and Zoom breathes in and out, all once a loop of the Master Gear. Pull the cable out of Rotate's Angle and drag the knob yourself, or swap the order of Rotate and Zoom."
        }
